<section class="py-8 sm:py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div id="multi-slide" class="relative mb-8 w-full" x-data>
      <div class="mb-12 flex justify-between gap-8 max-md:flex-col sm:mb-16 md:items-end md:gap-16 lg:mb-24">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium">FAQS</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">
            Your Questions Answered
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl">
            Levarage artificial intelligence algorithms to provide users with
            <br />
            valuable insights
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <button
            type="button"
            aria-label="Previous slide"
            class="relative grid size-10 shrink-0 cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-full border transition-colors"
            x-on:click="$refs.track.scrollBy({ left: -$refs.track.clientWidth, behavior: 'smooth' })"
          >
            <span class="icon-[tabler--arrow-left] size-5.5"></span>
          </button>
          <button
            type="button"
            aria-label="Next slide"
            class="relative grid size-10 shrink-0 cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-full border transition-colors"
            x-on:click="$refs.track.scrollBy({ left: $refs.track.clientWidth, behavior: 'smooth' })"
          >
            <span class="icon-[tabler--arrow-right] size-5.5"></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl">
        <div
          class="flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-6 overflow-x-auto scroll-smooth [scrollbar-width:none]"
          x-ref="track"
        >
          <!-- Slide 1 -->
          <div class="w-full shrink-0 snap-start lg:w-[calc(100%/3-16px)]">
            <div class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-6">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                  <div class="grid size-11.5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full">
                    <span class="icon-[tabler--home] size-6.5"></span>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="text-3xl font-bold">What does your company do?</h5>
                  <p class="text-sm">
                    Our company specializes in delivering high-quality solutions
                    that are tailored to meet the evolving needs of businesses
                    and individuals. Whether it’s a digital product, a creative
                    service, or a custom solution, we focus on combining
                    functionality with design to help our clients grow, improve
                    efficiency, and connect better with their audience.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Slide 2 -->
          <div class="w-full shrink-0 snap-start lg:w-[calc(100%/3-16px)]">
            <div class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-6">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                  <div class="grid size-11.5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full">
                    <span class="icon-[tabler--box] size-6.5"></span>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                    Do you offer custom packages?
                  </h5>
                  <p class="text-sm">
                    Our pricing is designed to be flexible and transparent, with
                    options to suit a variety of travel styles and budgets. We
                    offer both fixed packages and fully customized plans,
                    allowing you to choose the level of service and experience
                    you want. Whether you're planning a quick getaway or a
                    luxury vacation.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Slide 3 -->
          <div class="w-full shrink-0 snap-start lg:w-[calc(100%/3-16px)]">
            <div class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-6">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                  <div class="grid size-11.5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full">
                    <span class="icon-[tabler--currency-dollar] size-6.5"></span>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                    What is your pricing structure?
                  </h5>
                  <p class="text-sm">
                    Our pricing structure is flexible and depends on the scope
                    and complexity of your project. We offer both standard
                    packages and custom quotes to fit your specific needs. For
                    detailed pricing information or a personalized quote, please
                    contact us directly — we’re happy to discuss options that
                    work for your budget.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Slide 4 -->
          <div class="w-full shrink-0 snap-start lg:w-[calc(100%/3-16px)]">
            <div class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-6">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                  <div class="grid size-11.5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full">
                    <span class="icon-[tabler--users] size-6.5"></span>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                    Do you offer ongoing support ?
                  </h5>
                  <p class="text-sm">
                    Yes, we do! Our team is here to assist you before, during,
                    and even after your trip to ensure everything goes smoothly.
                    Whether you need help with last-minute changes, local
                    recommendations, or unexpected issues, we’re just a call or
                    message away to provide reliable support every step of the
                    way.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Slide 5 -->
          <div class="w-full shrink-0 snap-start lg:w-[calc(100%/3-16px)]">
            <div class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-6">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                  <div class="grid size-11.5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full">
                    <span class="icon-[tabler--clock] size-6.5"></span>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                    How long project take to complete?
                  </h5>
                  <p class="text-sm">
                    Project timelines vary depending on the complexity and scope
                    of the work. A standard project usually takes between 2 to 6
                    weeks. We'll provide a detailed timeline after discussing
                    your specific requirements. More the complexity it takes
                    more time compare to basic projects. But matter is the
                    quality of the project work.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Slide 6 -->
          <div class="w-full shrink-0 snap-start lg:w-[calc(100%/3-16px)]">
            <div class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-6">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                  <div class="grid size-11.5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full">
                    <span class="icon-[tabler--user] size-6.5"></span>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                    Is there a contract or agreement involved?
                  </h5>
                  <p class="text-sm">
                    Yes, there is! To ensure clarity and peace of mind, we
                    provide a simple agreement that outlines the trip details,
                    inclusions, terms, and responsibilities. It helps both sides
                    stay aligned and ensures everything is clearly communicated
                    before your journey begins. We'll provide a detailed timeline
                    after discussing your specific requirements.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Slide 7 -->
          <div class="w-full shrink-0 snap-start lg:w-[calc(100%/3-16px)]">
            <div class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-6">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                  <div class="grid size-11.5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full">
                    <span class="icon-[tabler--help] size-6.5"></span>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                    What if I’m not satisfied with the results?
                  </h5>
                  <p class="text-sm">
                    Client satisfaction is our top priority. We offer revision
                    rounds and encourage ongoing feedback throughout the project
                    to ensure the final result aligns with your vision. If
                    there’s ever a concern, we’ll work with you to make it
                    right.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Slide 8 -->
          <div class="w-full shrink-0 snap-start lg:w-[calc(100%/3-16px)]">
            <div class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-6">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                  <div class="grid size-11.5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full">
                    <span class="icon-[tabler--car] size-6.5"></span>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                    Do you offer travel insurance?
                  </h5>
                  <p class="text-sm">
                    While we don’t directly provide travel insurance, we partner
                    with reputable providers and can help you choose a plan that
                    covers trip cancellations, medical emergencies, and other
                    unexpected events.. We'll provide a detailed timeline after
                    discussing your specific requirements, and we keep you
                    updated at every stage.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
